Open the class source panel from a method's source display.
Show editable current definition, file revisions and an inspectable Git object link.
Keep per-class drafts and base digests when switching/closing/refreshing.
Selecting history displays old source; copying it to editor is separate from saving.
Save sends current draft/digest and reports the new-object behavior change.
Working diff displays saved file differences. Commit requires a saved buffer and
message; only the selected file is committed. Late responses cannot replace a
different class's editor. Layout stacks on small screens; text stays inside panes.
